    <abstract>
        <para>Records of Invasive Non-native Species (INNS) held within the LERN database which have been marked as having been validated (within LERN proceedures). This is a subset of the &amp;#39;LERN Records&amp;#39; dataset to enable INNS records to be published at full resolution.</para>
